caption:
Indian outfits in GTA are getting SO expensive… but not every store is worth what they charge 👀

After shopping around the GTA, these are the ones I’d actually spend my money at:

@skorchid_ - if you want fusion wear, this is the spot! They have a lot of indo western items and prices vary. They also have sales often so wait for one of those. 

@kanadakulture - if you want an affordable piece, this is the spot! 

@mastani.ca - new spot in GTA but have a range of outfits in different price ranges. There’s also an escalator with suits on it that makes it SO easy to see everything so you’re not getting someone to open 50 different bags. 

@siaimporter - definitely not the cheapest prices but you will never find a bad quality suit here. They carry big designers and can customize everything. This is my go to spot when I can’t find anything. 

Especially with weddings, events, and kids… this stuff adds up quickly. I’m not about to spend $500+ unless it actually makes sense.

Save this for wedding season & follow for more money-smart finds for moms in Canada 🇨🇦

💬 comment below with any stores I missed! I’m always looking for a good find! 💕
